# Generated output must be byte-identical on every platform.
#
# `trustrail.contracts.export` writes UTF-8 with explicit LF, and the Hardhat deploy script
# writes LF too. Without these rules, a checkout under `core.autocrlf=true` converts them to
# CRLF in the working tree, so the next export rewrites every file and a reviewer cannot tell
# a real wire-contract change from a line-ending one.
#
# The promise is that a clean `git diff` means the contract did not move. That has to hold for
# a reviewer on macOS reading a commit made on Windows.
contracts/**       text eol=lf
onchain/deployments/*.json text eol=lf
